on any Windows computer you own or control, for personal and commercial
purposes. The Software is provided free of charge.

2. PERMITTED USE

You may:

  - Install the Software on an unlimited number of your own computers.
  - Use the Software to install, update and launch Arctisoft applications
    and to manage your Arctisoft account, licenses and purchases.
  - Make backup copies of the installer for personal archival purposes.
  - Distribute the original, unmodified installer for promotional
    purposes.

3. RESTRICTIONS

You may not:

