    automatically.
  - 14-day money-back guarantee: you may ask for a full refund of a
    Premium license within 14 days of purchase, without giving a reason.
    The license ends when the refund is issued.
  - Statutory consumer rights remain unaffected.
  - For purchase, refund or license delivery questions, contact
    support@arctisoft-studio.com.

